    "_comment": "Arizona has party registration but NO single statewide by-party early-vote feed: each of the 15 county recorders publishes separately (Maricopa daily ballot-return stats + others), in different formats. az_update.py is a MULTI-COUNTY AGGREGATOR: it iterates `counties`, runs a registered per-county parser (scripts/az_update.py PARSERS[fips]) where one exists, and merges results into the statewide by-party schema. Per-county parsers are added as each county's live feed is confirmed (the routine wires them, biggest-first: Maricopa 04013, Pima 04019, Pinal 04021, Maricopa covers ~60% of AZ voters). Reads 0 for counties without a wired parser.",
